-six digits twice. After the next power-on, enter that PIN and press **OK**. The radio and its host services
+four digits twice. An existing six-digit PIN keeps its original length until changed. After the next power-on, enter that PIN and press **OK**. The radio and its host services
 start after the PIN is accepted. Changing or removing the PIN requires the current PIN. Three wrong attempts
